
======================================================================
 (A) verify w_2 = C(n,3)+2c_3 and w_3 = C(n,4)+(2n-3)c_3 (exact)
======================================================================
  checked 1200 random tournaments n=3..10 -- failures: 0
  => w_k = (transitive count C(n,k+1)) + spectral cycle-count corrections.

======================================================================
 (B) recentred reciprocity (1+F(x))(1+F(-x-1))=1, centre x=-1/2 (exact)
======================================================================
    x=2:  (1+F(x))(1+F(-x-1)) = 1;  (1+F(x))-G(x) = 0
    x=3:  (1+F(x))(1+F(-x-1)) = 1;  (1+F(x))-G(x) = 0
    x=-5/2:  (1+F(x))(1+F(-x-1)) = 1;  (1+F(x))-G(x) = 0
    x=7/3:  (1+F(x))(1+F(-x-1)) = 1;  (1+F(x))-G(x) = 0
    x=15/14:  (1+F(x))(1+F(-x-1)) = 1;  (1+F(x))-G(x) = 0
  reciprocity + closed form hold at all tested points: True
  fixed point of x->-x-1 is x=-1/2 (same -1/2 as central-factorial structure).

======================================================================
 (C) complement fixed-point  F_{A'}=h/(1-h), h=-F_A(-x-1), A'=A^T (exact)
======================================================================
    x=2:  F_A=-225/11  F_A^T=-225/11  h/(1-h)=-225/11  (all equal: True)
    x=5/2:  F_A=42488/1259  F_A^T=42488/1259  h/(1-h)=42488/1259  (all equal: True)
    x=-3:  F_A=-225/214  F_A^T=-225/214  h/(1-h)=-225/214  (all equal: True)
    x=9/4:  F_A=-5561160/54479  F_A^T=-5561160/54479  h/(1-h)=-5561160/54479  (all equal: True)
  complement relation + tournament self-reference hold: True

  Tournament walk function = fixed point of the graph-complement walk map;
  the reciprocity is its fixed-point equation.
